# Line endings are pinned here so they no longer depend on each machine's Git
# config. Without this file, Windows checkouts with and without core.autocrlf
# saw the same tree as clean or as ~400 modified files (2026-11-05).
#
# Text is stored and checked out with LF. Vercel builds on Linux, shebang
# scripts need LF, and every editor in use reads LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
